    "scenesThatPass": [
      "MALEFICENT: You don't have to pretend. It's no secret. Everyone knows that...\nULLA: Maleficent!\nULLA: Ever since that tragic night that you were born, I have tried to find the good in you. I have tried for my sister's sake.\nULLA: But I have failed because there is no good in you. You're a devilish thing! You were born that way.",
      "MALEFICENT: They're not happy when we walk.\nFLITTLE: Maleficent. Those horns are perfect on you.",
      "FLITTLE: Go live with humans, halfling.\nMALEFICENT: I'm a halfling too! Call me a halfling. Go ahead!\nMALEFICENT: Never mind them.\nKNOTGRASS: You killed your mother.",
      "THISTLEWIT: Who will be Queen now?\nFLITTLE: No one knows. She had no heirs.\nKNOTGRASS: The Stone knows.\nTHISTLEWIT: What stone?",
      "MALEFICENT: What is this?\nFLITTLE: I'm in charge of Blue. It's a big responsibility."
    ]
  },
